{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-002-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/EarningsReconciliationTests.cs","line":2188,"method":"PostWalk_MilestoneAchievement_PrunedByCommittedThreshold_Skipped_NoWarn","category":"T1","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/PostWalkActionReconciler.cs:518; remove the UT<=prune-threshold skip -> stays green (the empty-events action is skipped at :545 by the no-live-observed-event gate); making IsOutsidePostWalkLiveCoverage a no-op -> red","what_it_asserts":"No post-walk WARN for a MilestoneAchievement at UT 600 while a committed milestone watermark ends at 650.","why_weak":"The fixture passes an empty events list, so the live-coverage gate already skips the action; neither the prune threshold nor the committed-milestone setup affects the outcome, and removing the named gate at :518 leaves the cell green.","proposed_action":"Include a FundsChanged(Progression) event at UT 600 with a divergent delta (e.g. 123) so a missing prune WARNs and reds the cell; or assert the emitted skip line 'ut is at/below live prune threshold=650.0' (PostWalkActionReconciler.cs:520-524).","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-002-02","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/EarningsReconciliationTests.cs","line":3210,"method":"PostWalk_DoubleWarnGuard_TransformedActionOnlyFiresOnce","category":"T1","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/KscActionReconciler.cs:83; delete the KscReconcileClass.Transformed skip so ReconcileKscAction reconciles and WARNs -> stays green, because the guard at test line 3254 requires the 'Earnings reconciliation' prefix while the KSC path emits 'KSC reconciliation (funds)'","what_it_asserts":"For a divergent ContractComplete, only ReconcilePostWalk warns; the per-action KSC reconciler stays silent on the Transformed type.","why_weak":"The absence assertion matches 'Earnings reconciliation' + '(funds)' but not '(post-walk)'; ReconcileKscAction's WARNs are prefixed 'KSC reconciliation (funds)' (:157/:174), so re-enabling the per-action WARN cannot red the cell - exactly the double-WARN regression its comment claims to catch. The first Contains is satisfied by the post-walk path alone.","proposed_action":"Assert DoesNotContain(l => l.Contains('KSC reconciliation')) and optionally assert the VERBOSE skip line 'KSC reconciliation: ContractComplete skipped' so the silent KSC path is positively witnessed.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-002-03","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/EarningsReconciliationTests.cs","line":3662,"method":"Reconcile_ContractComplete_NotEffective_SkipsEmitted_Silent","category":"T1","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/LedgerOrchestrator.cs:802; remove the if (!a.Effective) break; gate -> stays green (TransformedFundsReward/EffectiveRep/TransformedScienceReward are all 0); making the arm at :803 read raw FundsReward -> red","what_it_asserts":"An Effective=false ContractComplete (raw FundsReward 5000, Transformed* 0) produces no earnings-window WARN.","why_weak":"With TransformedFundsReward=0, EffectiveRep=0 and TransformedScienceReward=0 the gate the name claims is unobservable: emitted deltas are 0 with or without it. The cell only discriminates the raw-vs-transformed read, already pinned by Reconcile_ContractComplete_TransformedFundsReward_RawDelta_Warns (line 3626).","proposed_action":"Set TransformedFundsReward=5000 (plus non-zero EffectiveRep/TransformedScienceReward) while keeping Effective=false and an empty events list, so the gate becomes load-bearing; the MilestoneAchievement sibling at line 3690 already uses non-zero awards.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
